<TXSPN>"You say I'll be fine, but... I'm not that strong..."<PG>
"No...! No...!
{PAUSE ""}
　In a world without <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>...!<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE>In a world where I became a murderer...!
{PAUSE ""}
　What am I supposed to do...!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
