{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'm scared... I want to run... 
{PAUSE ""}
Why does this have to happen to me...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ugh... why am I... such a coward..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, can you hear me?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
