{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみあおり2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "600" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花頭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "800" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n360\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>...! Didn't you go back...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n147\r\n人物2\r\n11\r\n0\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="1">"My precious </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> is crying. I'm not going to leave you behind."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n360\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物3\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみしゃがみ正面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "600" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">. It really hurts right now, doesn't it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you're hurting, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, it makes me sad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So I'll go with <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But listen, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花口開け.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "600" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "600" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"If you come with me now, is that really okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You really won't regret it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The people you left behind in that world, is it really fine to leave them like that?"</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花困り横目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"You see... I've been thinking..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I probably can't save you, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花口開け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Huh?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You've suffered and agonized this much, and </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> even know what you should do... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you kick </STYLE>your own<STYLE ID="1"> thinking aside and come with me anyway, what happens then?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, I think you'd go on regretting it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Regret...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, if you go home with me like this, will you really not regret it? There's no going back, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花困り横目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That regret, I'm sure there's nothing I could do about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, if you're hurting, I'm sad too, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">But... but listen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The only one who can help the people of that world is </STYLE>you, Haruka<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
"Maybe so, but..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of that world, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your mom, Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, my </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, they're waiting for </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> to come home. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The only one who can help them is </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, the only one who can help you is </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">, too."</STYLE><PG>
"But..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"You'd be abandoning them, but is that really okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You do understand that coming with me means abandoning everyone, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you still say you want to come with me, I won't stop you, okay? I think I'll have forgotten what happened here once I wake up anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But before that, tell me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, what do you want? What would make you happy from here on?"</STYLE><PG>
"I... 
{PAUSE ""}
what I should do is..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, no. Not what you should do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Tell me what you want to do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What I want to do..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What I want to do... What I wish for is..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花困り目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I want to be strong..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみ口開け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Strong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I've... always been weak... 
{PAUSE ""}
What happened in Megasawa, the way I've always leaned on <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
And more than anything, running away to this place... 
{PAUSE ""}
All of it, all of it, because I'm weak..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... You want to be strong, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"But the </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> I know isn't weak. I'm the one who's always getting helped by </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花困り横目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"............"<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, you want confidence. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
What you did<STYLE ID="1">, and losing me. The confidence and courage to accept those and go on living."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"If you come with me, will that confidence and courage come?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't think it would. If I did that, I'd be no different from the me up to now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... Then you already know, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Because, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, you're still standing your ground, even now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You know what you should do, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That... I know. 
{PAUSE ""}
To keep... my promise."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみ口開け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"A promise?"</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花目閉じ口閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Yeah... There's someone I promised. That I'd go back to my own world. 
{PAUSE ""}
Someone who didn't give up on me, who came all this way with me... 
{PAUSE ""}
No matter how many times I got it wrong, there was someone who didn't give up on me. So... 
{PAUSE ""}
If I can keep my promise to that person, I think I can accept what I did, and the reality that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> gone."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I want to keep my promise. Because then I can be strong. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I'm... going to be strong. I promise you that too, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, right here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみまじめ目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah."</STYLE><PG>
"I thought I'd made up my mind, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
when I saw your face, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, it all wobbled... 
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花笑顔困り.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Haha, I'm an idiot."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\なつみにこり.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"But that's only natural. I know how much it hurts, too."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花困り目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I'm ashamed... At this late hour, still being selfish, trying to break my promise... 
{PAUSE ""}
You're right, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>. If I went with <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, I'd regret it for sure. 
{PAUSE ""}
But still..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\真\春花苦痛.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I'm really scared...! Of a world without <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>! Of going back to the world where I killed <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>Can I even... live in a world like that..."
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, look."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "永劫回帰改.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
"What is this...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's how I feel about </STYLE>you, Haruka<STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In this world, people's hearts are reflected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">My heart moved the world, and this is what it made: how I feel about </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "システム音\ながれぼし.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, the world can be changed, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Not just this world. The world </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> were in, I'm sure your heart can change it too, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Your<STYLE ID="1"> heart moves the world. The rest is only what </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> do."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But for that, you'll surely need a strong heart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So even if it's only in this world, I want you to see my heart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This feeling I have for </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> will never, ever disappear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It goes on and on. It will always, always be at your side."</STYLE><PG>
